x0b: $ G , ∃ a (x ∊ P ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w (scons x r) ∧ z = ⟨ ssnoc f x , ⟨ scons x g , ⟨ scons D t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ z ∊ {y | ∃ x ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a (x ∊ P2 ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q2 w (scons x r) ∧ y = ⟨ ssnoc f x , ⟨ scons x g , ⟨ scons D2 t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)} $ by ex_elim [x0a, c4]
