lemma i4_x2g_sub {a y: set} (G: hyps) (Q Q2 D D2: class) (w r: set): $ G ⇒ Q = Q2 $ > $ G ⇒ D = D2 $ > $ G ⇒ {y | ∃ a (⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w r ∧ y = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)} ⊆ {y | ∃ a (⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q2 w r ∧ y = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D2 a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)} $
----
k1: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w r ∧ z = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w r ∧ z = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by ax
k2: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w r ∧ z = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w r $ by and_elim_l [k1]
k3: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w r ∧ z = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [k1]
h1: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w r ∧ z = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ Q = Q2 $ by weaken [#1]
h2: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w r ∧ z = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ D = D2 $ by weaken [#2]
w1: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w r ∧ z = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ w = w $ by eq_refl
w2: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w r ∧ z = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ r = r $ by eq_refl
e1: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w r ∧ z = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ da Q w r = da Q2 w r $ by da_eq [h1, w1, w2]
e2: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w r ∧ z = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q2 w r $ by wcel_eq_r [e1, k2]
w3: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w r ∧ z = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ a = a $ by eq_refl
w4: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w r ∧ z = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∅ = ∅ $ by eq_refl
e3: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w r ∧ z = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ scons D a = scons D2 a $ by scons_eq [h2, w3]
e4: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w r ∧ z = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , scons D a ⟩ = ⟨ ∅ , scons D2 a ⟩ $ by opair_eq [w4, e3]
e5: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w r ∧ z = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , scons D a ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , scons D2 a ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [w4, e4]
e6: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w r ∧ z = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D2 a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [w4, e5]
e7: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w r ∧ z = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D2 a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by eq_trans [k3, e6]
c1: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w r ∧ z = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q2 w r ∧ z = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D2 a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_intro [e2, e7]
c2: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w r ∧ z = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ ∃ a (⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q2 w r ∧ z = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D2 a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) $ by ex_intro [c1]
c3: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w r ∧ z = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ {y | ∃ a (⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q2 w r ∧ y = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D2 a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)} $ by cab_intro [c2]
m1: $ G , z ∊ {y | ∃ a (⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w r ∧ y = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)} ⇒ z ∊ {y | ∃ a (⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w r ∧ y = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)} $ by ax
m2: $ G , z ∊ {y | ∃ a (⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w r ∧ y = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)} ⇒ ∃ a (⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w r ∧ z = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) $ by cab_elim [m1]
m3: $ G , z ∊ {y | ∃ a (⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w r ∧ y = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)} ⇒ z ∊ {y | ∃ a (⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q2 w r ∧ y = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D2 a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)} $ by ex_elim [m2, c3]
m4: $ G ⇒ {y | ∃ a (⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q w r ∧ y = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)} ⊆ {y | ∃ a (⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da Q2 w r ∧ y = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , (scons D2 a) ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)} $ by subset_intro [m3]

lemma i4_etb_eqv (G: hyps) (E E2 K V: class) (u s: set):
  $ G ⇒ eagv u E E2 $ > $ G ⇒ etb u E K s V = etb u E2 K s V $
----
e0: $ G , w ∊ lvals , r ∊ fseq u ⇒ eagv u E E2 $ by weaken [#1]
e1a: $ G , w ∊ lvals , r ∊ fseq u ⇒ isset s $ by isset_var
e1: $ G , w ∊ lvals , r ∊ fseq u ⇒ isset (fv s ∅) $ by fv_set_l [e1a]
e2: $ G , w ∊ lvals , r ∊ fseq u ⇒ isset (fv s (suc ∅)) $ by fv_set_l [e1a]
e3a: $ G , w ∊ lvals , r ∊ fseq u ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by ax
e3: $ G , w ∊ lvals , r ∊ fseq u ⇒ w ∈ lvals $ by welc_wcel [e3a]
e4a: $ G , w ∊ lvals , r ∊ fseq u ⇒ r ∊ fseq u $ by ax
e4: $ G , w ∊ lvals , r ∊ fseq u ⇒ r ∈ fseq u $ by welc_wcel [e4a]
e5: $ G , w ∊ lvals , r ∊ fseq u ⇒ da (fv E (fv s ∅)) w r = da (fv E2 (fv s ∅)) w r $ by i4_eagv_at [e0, e1, e3, e4]
e5s: $ G , w ∊ lvals , r ∊ fseq u ⇒ da (fv E2 (fv s ∅)) w r = da (fv E (fv s ∅)) w r $ by eq_sym [e5]
e6: $ G , w ∊ lvals , r ∊ fseq u ⇒ da (fv E (fv s (suc ∅))) w r = da (fv E2 (fv s (suc ∅))) w r $ by i4_eagv_at [e0, e2, e3, e4]
e6s: $ G , w ∊ lvals , r ∊ fseq u ⇒ da (fv E2 (fv s (suc ∅))) w r = da (fv E (fv s (suc ∅))) w r $ by eq_sym [e6]
e7: $ G , w ∊ lvals , r ∊ fseq u ⇒ fv V (suc ∅) = fv V (suc ∅) $ by eq_refl
e8: $ G , w ∊ lvals , r ∊ fseq u ⇒ da (fv V ∅) w r = da (fv V ∅) w r $ by eq_refl
e9: $ G , w ∊ lvals , r ∊ fseq u ⇒ fv V ∅ = fv V ∅ $ by eq_refl
f1: $ G , w ∊ lvals , r ∊ fseq u ⇒ {y | ∃ x ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a (x ∊ da (fv E (fv s ∅)) w r ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da (fv V (suc ∅)) w (scons x r) ∧ y = ⟨ ssnoc f x , ⟨ scons x g , ⟨ scons (da (fv V ∅) w r) t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)} ⊆ {y | ∃ x ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a (x ∊ da (fv E2 (fv s ∅)) w r ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da (fv V (suc ∅)) w (scons x r) ∧ y = ⟨ ssnoc f x , ⟨ scons x g , ⟨ scons (da (fv V ∅) w r) t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)} $ by i4_x1g_sub [e5, e7, e8]
f2: $ G , w ∊ lvals , r ∊ fseq u ⇒ {y | ∃ x ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a (x ∊ da (fv E2 (fv s ∅)) w r ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da (fv V (suc ∅)) w (scons x r) ∧ y = ⟨ ssnoc f x , ⟨ scons x g , ⟨ scons (da (fv V ∅) w r) t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)} ⊆ {y | ∃ x ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a (x ∊ da (fv E (fv s ∅)) w r ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da (fv V (suc ∅)) w (scons x r) ∧ y = ⟨ ssnoc f x , ⟨ scons x g , ⟨ scons (da (fv V ∅) w r) t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)} $ by i4_x1g_sub [e5s, e7, e8]
