f2: $ H , z = ⟨ kc_cons , scons a (scons p ∅) ⟩ ∧ c = b ∧ d = t ∧ ra_pis p ⟨ kc_pi , scons a (scons b ∅) ⟩ t ∈ lrel ⇒ crn (scons p ∅) ⊆ i5_pip u M w s $ by crn_scons_tail [f1]
