y0a: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i5_pip u M w s , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , z ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ctx , ra_pis z c d ∈ lrel , c ∊ trees ω , ∃ a ∃ b ∃ t ∃ p (z = ⟨ kc_cons , scons a (scons p ∅) ⟩ ∧ c = b ∧ d = t ∧ ra_pis p ⟨ kc_pi , scons a (scons b ∅) ⟩ t ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ a ∃ b ∃ t ∃ p (z = ⟨ kc_cons , scons a (scons p ∅) ⟩ ∧ c = b ∧ d = t ∧ ra_pis p ⟨ kc_pi , scons a (scons b ∅) ⟩ t ∈ lrel) $ by ax
