t1: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i5_pip u M w s , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ i5_pip u M w s $ by i5_pip_i [s4]
t2a: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i5_pip u M w s , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ $ by ax
t2: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i5_pip u M w s , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ i5_pip u M w s $ by wcel_intro [t2a, t1]
t3a: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i5_pip u M w s ⇒ isset ⟨ k , j ⟩ $ by opair_isset
t3: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i5_pip u M w s ⇒ ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ i5_pip u M w s $ by isset_elim [t3a, t2]
t4: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ⇒ crn j ⊆ i5_pip u M w s → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ i5_pip u M w s $ by imp_intro [t3]
t5: $ G , k ∊ ω ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ i5_pip u M w s → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ i5_pip u M w s $ by imp_intro [t4]
t6: $ G ⇒ k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ i5_pip u M w s → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ i5_pip u M w s $ by imp_intro [t5]
t7: $ G ⇒ ∀ j (k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ i5_pip u M w s → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ i5_pip u M w s) $ by all_intro [t6]
t8: $ G ⇒ ∀ k ∀ j (k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ i5_pip u M w s → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ i5_pip u M w s) $ by all_intro [t7]
t9a: $ G ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
t9: $ G ⇒ trees ω ⊆ i5_pip u M w s $ by trees_ind_c [t9a, t8]
f1: $ G ⇒ t1 ∈ trees ω $ by lsig_ofsort_trees [#3]
