f0b: $ H , z = ⟨ kc_cons , scons a (scons p ∅) ⟩ ∧ c = b ∧ d = t ∧ ra_lams p ⟨ kc_lam , scons a (scons b ∅) ⟩ t ∈ lrel ⇒ z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ $ by weaken [#6]
f0c: $ H , z = ⟨ kc_cons , scons a (scons p ∅) ⟩ ∧ c = b ∧ d = t ∧ ra_lams p ⟨ kc_lam , scons a (scons b ∅) ⟩ t ∈ lrel ⇒ kc_cons ∈ ω $ by kc_cons_omega
