f1: $ H , z = ⟨ kc_cons , scons a (scons p ∅) ⟩ ∧ c = b ∧ d = t ∧ ra_lams p ⟨ kc_lam , scons a (scons b ∅) ⟩ t ∈ lrel ⇒ crn (scons a (scons p ∅)) ⊆ i5_lap u M w s $ by i5_ch [f0a, f0b, e1, f0d, f0g]
f2: $ H , z = ⟨ kc_cons , scons a (scons p ∅) ⟩ ∧ c = b ∧ d = t ∧ ra_lams p ⟨ kc_lam , scons a (scons b ∅) ⟩ t ∈ lrel ⇒ crn (scons p ∅) ⊆ i5_lap u M w s $ by crn_scons_tail [f1]
