f4: $ H , z = ⟨ kc_cons , scons a (scons p ∅) ⟩ ∧ c = b ∧ d = t ∧ ra_lams p ⟨ kc_lam , scons a (scons b ∅) ⟩ t ∈ lrel ⇒ a ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr ∧ p ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_ctx $ by i5_ctx_kids [f4a, e1]
