b10a: $ G , y ∊ i6_rr u M w z x0 , g ∊ sat u M x0 w ∧ p ∊ esat u (dsh u M g) z w ∧ y = scat p g ⇒ sat u M x0 w ⊆ fseq u $ by sat_fseq
b10: $ G , y ∊ i6_rr u M w z x0 , g ∊ sat u M x0 w ∧ p ∊ esat u (dsh u M g) z w ∧ y = scat p g ⇒ g ∊ fseq u $ by subset_elim [b10a, b4]
b11: $ G , y ∊ i6_rr u M w z x0 , g ∊ sat u M x0 w ∧ p ∊ esat u (dsh u M g) z w ∧ y = scat p g ⇒ scat ∅ g = g $ by scat_empty_l [b10]
b12a: $ G , y ∊ i6_rr u M w z x0 , g ∊ sat u M x0 w ∧ p ∊ esat u (dsh u M g) z w ∧ y = scat p g ⇒ g = g $ by eq_refl
b12: $ G , y ∊ i6_rr u M w z x0 , g ∊ sat u M x0 w ∧ p ∊ esat u (dsh u M g) z w ∧ y = scat p g ⇒ scat p g = scat ∅ g $ by scat_eq [b9, b12a]
b13a: $ G , y ∊ i6_rr u M w z x0 , g ∊ sat u M x0 w ∧ p ∊ esat u (dsh u M g) z w ∧ y = scat p g ⇒ y = scat ∅ g $ by eq_trans [b5b, b12]
b13: $ G , y ∊ i6_rr u M w z x0 , g ∊ sat u M x0 w ∧ p ∊ esat u (dsh u M g) z w ∧ y = scat p g ⇒ y = g $ by eq_trans [b13a, b11]
b14: $ G , y ∊ i6_rr u M w z x0 , g ∊ sat u M x0 w ∧ p ∊ esat u (dsh u M g) z w ∧ y = scat p g ⇒ g = y $ by eq_sym [b13]
b15: $ G , y ∊ i6_rr u M w z x0 , g ∊ sat u M x0 w ∧ p ∊ esat u (dsh u M g) z w ∧ y = scat p g ⇒ y ∊ sat u M x0 w $ by welc_eq_set [b14, b4]
wb16_8: $ G , g ∊ sat u M x0 w ∧ p ∊ esat u (dsh u M g) z w ∧ y = scat p g , y ∊ i6_rr u M w z x0 ⇒ x1 = x0 $ by weaken [#3]
b16: $ G , y ∊ i6_rr u M w z x0 , g ∊ sat u M x0 w ∧ p ∊ esat u (dsh u M g) z w ∧ y = scat p g ⇒ x0 = x1 $ by eq_sym [wb16_8]
