b18: $ G , y ∊ i6_rr u M w z x0 , ∃ p (g ∊ sat u M x0 w ∧ p ∊ esat u (dsh u M g) z w ∧ y = scat p g) ⇒ y ∊ sat u M x1 w $ by ex_elim [b18a, b17]
