g2: $ G , y ∊ sat u M x1 w , q ∊ sat u M d w ∧ x ∊ dt u M a w q ∧ y = scons x q ⇒ x ∊ dt u M a w q $ by and_elim_l [g2a]
g3: $ G , y ∊ sat u M x1 w , q ∊ sat u M d w ∧ x ∊ dt u M a w q ∧ y = scons x q ⇒ y = scons x q $ by and_elim_r [g2a]
