i16: $ G , y ∊ sat u M x1 w , q ∊ sat u M d w ∧ x ∊ dt u M a w q ∧ y = scons x q , g ∊ sat u M b w ∧ p ∊ esat u (dsh u M g) c w ∧ q = scat p g , e = scons x p ⇒ {r | r ∊ fseq u ∧ ∃ x ∃ q (q ∊ esat u (dsh u M g) c w ∧ x ∊ da (fv (dsh u M g) a) w q ∧ r = scons x q)} = esat u (dsh u M g) ⟨ kc_cons , scons a (scons c ∅) ⟩ w $ by eq_sym [wi16_23]
