lrel_capp_sem
-------------
l3a: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i6_cap u M w ⇒ k ∊ ω $ by ax
l3b: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i6_cap u M w ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by ax
l3c: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i6_cap u M w ⇒ crn j ⊆ i6_cap u M w $ by ax
wl3_59: $ G , crn j ⊆ i6_cap u M w , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , k ∊ ω ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by weaken [#4]
l3: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i6_cap u M w ⇒ ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ i6_cap u M w $ by i6_cap_step [wl3_59, l3a, l3b, l3c]
l4: $ G ⇒ trees ω ⊆ i6_cap u M w $ by i6_tind [l3]
l5: $ G ⇒ t1 ∊ i6_cap u M w $ by subset_elim [l4, #2]
l6: $ G ⇒ t1 ∈ i6_cap u M w $ by welc_wcel [l5]
l7: $ G ⇒ sat u M t3 w = {y | ∃ g ∃ p (g ∊ sat u M t2 w ∧ p ∊ esat u (dsh u M g) t1 w ∧ y = scat p g)} $ by i6_cap_e [l6, #1]

--| The trees `y` at which every valuation has the length given by `clen`.
def i6_clp (U E W: class) (.y .a .b: set): class = $ {y | ∀ a ∀ b (ra_clen y a ∈ lrel → b ∊ esat U E y W → cdm b = fv nvf a)} $

lemma i6_clp_e (G: hyps) (E: class) (u w b c q: set): $ G ⇒ b ∈ i6_clp u E w $ > $ G ⇒ ra_clen b c ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ q ∊ esat u E b w $ > $ G ⇒ cdm q = fv nvf c $
----
l0: $ G ⇒ b ∊ i6_clp u E w $ by wcel_welc [#1]
l1: $ G ⇒ ∀ x0 ∀ x1 (ra_clen b x0 ∈ lrel → x1 ∊ esat u E b w → cdm x1 = fv nvf x0) $ by cab_elim [l0]
l2: $ G ⇒ ∀ x1 (ra_clen b c ∈ lrel → x1 ∊ esat u E b w → cdm x1 = fv nvf c) $ by all_elim [l1]
l3: $ G ⇒ ra_clen b c ∈ lrel → q ∊ esat u E b w → cdm q = fv nvf c $ by all_elim [l2]
l4: $ G ⇒ q ∊ esat u E b w → cdm q = fv nvf c $ by imp_elim [l3, #2]
l5: $ G ⇒ cdm q = fv nvf c $ by imp_elim [l4, #3]

lemma i6_cl_step (G: hyps) (E: class) (u w k j: set): $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ k ∊ ω $ > $ G ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ > $ G ⇒ crn j ⊆ i6_clp u E w $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ i6_clp u E w $
----
a1: $ G , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_clen z x0 ∈ lrel , x1 ∊ esat u E z w ⇒ ra_clen z x0 ∈ lrel $ by ax
a2: $ G , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_clen z x0 ∈ lrel , x1 ∊ esat u E z w ⇒ (z = ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ ∧ x0 = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩) ∨ ∃ a ∃ b ∃ c (z = ⟨ kc_cons , scons a (scons b ∅) ⟩ ∧ x0 = ⟨ kc_s , scons c ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_clen b c ∈ lrel) $ by lrel_clen_cases [a1]
