b9: $ G , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_clen z x0 ∈ lrel , x1 ∊ esat u E z w , z = ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ ∧ x0 = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ cdm ∅ = ∅ $ by cdm_empty
b10: $ G , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_clen z x0 ∈ lrel , x1 ∊ esat u E z w , z = ⟨ kc_nil , ∅ ⟩ ∧ x0 = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ⇒ cdm x1 = ∅ $ by eq_trans [b8, b9]
