l3b: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i6_clp u E w ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by ax
l3c: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i6_clp u E w ⇒ crn j ⊆ i6_clp u E w $ by ax
wl3_12: $ G , crn j ⊆ i6_clp u E w , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , k ∊ ω ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by weaken [l2]
l3: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i6_clp u E w ⇒ ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ i6_clp u E w $ by i6_cl_step [wl3_12, l3a, l3b, l3c]
l4: $ G ⇒ trees ω ⊆ i6_clp u E w $ by i6_tind [l3]
