l6: $ G ⇒ t1 ∈ i6_clp u E w $ by welc_wcel [l5]
l7: $ G ⇒ cdm p = fv nvf t2 $ by i6_clp_e [l6, #1, #3]

lemma i6_sarg_csn (G: hyps) (E T W R B: class) (u: set): $ G ⇒ etel u E T W R = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , B ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ > $ G ⇒ isset B $ > $ G ⇒ sarg u E T W R = B $
----
a1: $ G , y ∊ sarg u E T W R ⇒ y ∊ sarg u E T W R $ by ax
a2: $ G , y ∊ sarg u E T W R ⇒ ∃ a (⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T W R ∧ y ∈ a) $ by cab_elim [a1]
b1: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T W R ∧ y ∈ a ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T W R ∧ y ∈ a $ by ax
b2: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T W R ∧ y ∈ a ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T W R $ by and_elim_l [b1]
wb3_1: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T W R ∧ y ∈ a ⇒ etel u E T W R = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , B ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by weaken [#1]
b3: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T W R ∧ y ∈ a ⇒ etel u E T W R = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , B ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by weaken [wb3_1]
b4: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T W R ∧ y ∈ a ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , B ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by wcel_eq_r [b3, b2]
b5: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T W R ∧ y ∈ a ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , B ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by i6_csn_elim [b4]
b6: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T W R ∧ y ∈ a ⇒ isset a $ by isset_var
wb7_2: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T W R ∧ y ∈ a ⇒ isset B $ by weaken [#2]
b7: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T W R ∧ y ∈ a ⇒ isset B $ by weaken [wb7_2]
b8: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T W R ∧ y ∈ a ⇒ a = B $ by i6_tri_inj [b5, b6, b7]
b9: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T W R ∧ y ∈ a ⇒ y ∈ a $ by and_elim_r [b1]
b10: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T W R ∧ y ∈ a ⇒ y ∊ a $ by wcel_welc [b9]
b11: $ G , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T W R ∧ y ∈ a ⇒ y ∊ B $ by welc_eq [b8, b10]
b12: $ G , y ∊ sarg u E T W R ⇒ y ∊ B $ by ex_elim [a2, b11]
c1: $ G , y ∊ B , b = B ⇒ b = B $ by ax
c2: $ G , y ∊ B , b = B ⇒ isset ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , B ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_isset
c3: $ G , y ∊ B , b = B ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , B ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , B ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by i6_csn_self [c2]
wc4_3: $ G , b = B , y ∊ B ⇒ etel u E T W R = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , B ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by weaken [#1]
c4: $ G , y ∊ B , b = B ⇒ etel u E T W R = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , B ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by weaken [wc4_3]
c5: $ G , y ∊ B , b = B ⇒ csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , B ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ = etel u E T W R $ by eq_sym [c4]
c6: $ G , y ∊ B , b = B ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , B ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T W R $ by wcel_eq_r [c5, c3]
c7: $ G , y ∊ B , b = B ⇒ ∅ = ∅ $ by eq_refl
c8: $ G , y ∊ B , b = B ⇒ B = b $ by eq_sym [c1]
c9: $ G , y ∊ B , b = B ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , B ⟩ = ⟨ ∅ , b ⟩ $ by opair_eq [c7, c8]
c10: $ G , y ∊ B , b = B ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , B ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , b ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [c7, c9]
c11: $ G , y ∊ B , b = B ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , B ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , b ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [c7, c10]
c12: $ G , y ∊ B , b = B ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , b ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T W R $ by wcel_eq_l [c11, c6]
c13: $ G , y ∊ B , b = B ⇒ y ∊ B $ by ax
c14: $ G , y ∊ B , b = B ⇒ y ∊ b $ by welc_eq [c8, c13]
c15: $ G , y ∊ B , b = B ⇒ y ∈ b $ by welc_wcel [c14]
c16: $ G , y ∊ B , b = B ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , b ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T W R ∧ y ∈ b $ by and_intro [c12, c15]
c17: $ G , y ∊ B , b = B ⇒ ∃ a (⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u E T W R ∧ y ∈ a) $ by ex_intro [c16]
c18: $ G , y ∊ B , b = B ⇒ y ∊ sarg u E T W R $ by cab_intro [c17]
wc19_4: $ G , y ∊ B ⇒ isset B $ by weaken [#2]
c19: $ G , y ∊ B ⇒ isset B $ by weaken [wc19_4]
c20: $ G , y ∊ B ⇒ y ∊ sarg u E T W R $ by isset_elim [c19, c18]
l1: $ G ⇒ sarg u E T W R = B $ by eq_intro [b12, c20]

lemma i6_etel_other (G: hyps) (E K S: class) (u w r: set): $ G ⇒ ⟨ K , S ⟩ ∈ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ ¬ K = kc_pi $ > $ G ⇒ ¬ K = kc_app $ > $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ r ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ etel u E ⟨ K , S ⟩ w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $
