wn2_5: $ G , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , k = kc_pi , k ∊ ω , ⟨ K , S ⟩ = ⟨ k , j ⟩ ⇒ K = k $ by weaken [m11]
n2: $ G , ⟨ K , S ⟩ = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , k = kc_pi ⇒ K = k $ by weaken [wn2_5]
n3: $ G , ⟨ K , S ⟩ = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , k = kc_pi ⇒ K = kc_pi $ by eq_trans [n2, n1]
wn4_6: $ G , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , k = kc_pi , k ∊ ω , ⟨ K , S ⟩ = ⟨ k , j ⟩ ⇒ ¬ K = kc_pi $ by weaken [#2]
