o3: $ G , ⟨ K , S ⟩ = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , k = kc_app ⇒ K = kc_app $ by eq_trans [o2, o1]
wo4_8: $ G , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , k = kc_app , k ∊ ω , ⟨ K , S ⟩ = ⟨ k , j ⟩ ⇒ ¬ K = kc_app $ by weaken [#3]
