p7: $ G , ⟨ K , S ⟩ = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ⇒ etel u E ⟨ K , S ⟩ w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by eq_trans [p6, p3]
