t4: $ G , h = ⟨ K , S ⟩ ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) h w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by eq_trans [t3, t2]
t5a: $ G , h = ⟨ K , S ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ K , S ⟩ = h $ by eq_sym [t1]
t5b: $ G , h = ⟨ K , S ⟩ ⇒ t2 = t2 $ by eq_refl
t5c: $ G , h = ⟨ K , S ⟩ ⇒ t3 = t3 $ by eq_refl
t5: $ G , h = ⟨ K , S ⟩ ⇒ ra_spine ⟨ K , S ⟩ t2 t3 = ra_spine h t2 t3 $ by ra_spine_eq [t5a, t5b, t5c]
wt6_77: $ G , h = ⟨ K , S ⟩ ⇒ ra_spine ⟨ K , S ⟩ t2 t3 ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#1]
t6: $ G , h = ⟨ K , S ⟩ ⇒ ra_spine h t2 t3 ∈ lrel $ by wcel_eq_l [t5, wt6_77]
t7: $ G , h = ⟨ K , S ⟩ , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i6_spp u M h w r ⇒ k ∊ ω $ by ax
t8: $ G , h = ⟨ K , S ⟩ , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i6_spp u M h w r ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by ax
t9: $ G , h = ⟨ K , S ⟩ , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i6_spp u M h w r ⇒ crn j ⊆ i6_spp u M h w r $ by ax
wt10_78: $ G , crn j ⊆ i6_spp u M h w r , h = ⟨ K , S ⟩ , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , k ∊ ω ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by weaken [#7]
wt10_79: $ G , crn j ⊆ i6_spp u M h w r , h = ⟨ K , S ⟩ , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , k ∊ ω ⇒ r ∊ fseq u $ by weaken [#8]
wt10_80: $ G , crn j ⊆ i6_spp u M h w r , h = ⟨ K , S ⟩ , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , k ∊ ω ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) h w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by weaken [t4]
t10: $ G , h = ⟨ K , S ⟩ , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i6_spp u M h w r ⇒ ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ i6_spp u M h w r $ by i6_sp_step [wt10_78, wt10_79, wt10_80, t7, t8, t9]
t11: $ G , h = ⟨ K , S ⟩ ⇒ trees ω ⊆ i6_spp u M h w r $ by i6_tind [t10]
