f9: $ G , h = ⟨ K , S ⟩ , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i6_spf u M h w r ⇒ crn j ⊆ i6_spf u M h w r $ by ax
wf10_81: $ G , crn j ⊆ i6_spf u M h w r , h = ⟨ K , S ⟩ , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , k ∊ ω ⇒ uadm u $ by weaken [#5]
