wf10_83: $ G , crn j ⊆ i6_spf u M h w r , h = ⟨ K , S ⟩ , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , k ∊ ω ⇒ r ∊ fseq u $ by weaken [#8]
wf10_84: $ G , crn j ⊆ i6_spf u M h w r , h = ⟨ K , S ⟩ , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , k ∊ ω ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) h w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by weaken [t4]
