k5: $ G , x5 = D ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) x w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , scat (swin r (fv nvf x5) (fv nvf n)) A ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ $ by and_elim_l [k4]
