k10: $ G , x5 = D ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) x w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , scat (swin r (fv nvf D) (fv nvf n)) A ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ dt u M x w r = apn (dt u M h w r) (swin r (fv nvf D) (fv nvf n)) $ by and_intro [k8, k9]
