a4: $ G , t1 = x4 ∧ t2 = x5 ∧ y = ⟨ kc_s , scons x9 ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = ⟨ kc_app , scons x6 (scons x8 ∅) ⟩ ∧ f = ⟨ kc_app , scons x7 (scons x8 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_rehead x4 x5 x9 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ⇒ y = ⟨ kc_s , scons x9 ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = ⟨ kc_app , scons x6 (scons x8 ∅) ⟩ ∧ f = ⟨ kc_app , scons x7 (scons x8 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_rehead x4 x5 x9 x6 x7 ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [a2]
a5: $ G , t1 = x4 ∧ t2 = x5 ∧ y = ⟨ kc_s , scons x9 ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = ⟨ kc_app , scons x6 (scons x8 ∅) ⟩ ∧ f = ⟨ kc_app , scons x7 (scons x8 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_rehead x4 x5 x9 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ⇒ y = ⟨ kc_s , scons x9 ∅ ⟩ $ by and_elim_l [a4]
a6: $ G , t1 = x4 ∧ t2 = x5 ∧ y = ⟨ kc_s , scons x9 ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = ⟨ kc_app , scons x6 (scons x8 ∅) ⟩ ∧ f = ⟨ kc_app , scons x7 (scons x8 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_rehead x4 x5 x9 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ⇒ e = ⟨ kc_app , scons x6 (scons x8 ∅) ⟩ ∧ f = ⟨ kc_app , scons x7 (scons x8 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_rehead x4 x5 x9 x6 x7 ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [a4]
