--| `sarg` under equal trees.
lemma i7_sarg_eq (G: hyps) (U E T T2 W R: class): $ G ⇒ T = T2 $ > $ G ⇒ sarg U E T W R = sarg U E T2 W R $
----
k0: $ G ⇒ W = W $ by eq_refl
k1: $ G ⇒ R = R $ by eq_refl
k2: $ G ⇒ etel U E T W R = etel U E T2 W R $ by etel_eq [#1, k0, k1]
k3: $ G ⇒ etel U E T2 W R = etel U E T W R $ by eq_sym [k2]
a1: $ G , x ∊ sarg U E T W R ⇒ x ∊ sarg U E T W R $ by ax
a2: $ G , x ∊ sarg U E T W R ⇒ ∃ a (⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel U E T W R ∧ x ∈ a) $ by cab_elim [a1]
b1: $ G , x ∊ sarg U E T W R , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel U E T W R ∧ x ∈ a ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel U E T W R ∧ x ∈ a $ by ax
b2: $ G , x ∊ sarg U E T W R , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel U E T W R ∧ x ∈ a ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel U E T W R $ by and_elim_l [b1]
b3: $ G , x ∊ sarg U E T W R , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel U E T W R ∧ x ∈ a ⇒ x ∈ a $ by and_elim_r [b1]
b4: $ G , x ∊ sarg U E T W R , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel U E T W R ∧ x ∈ a ⇒ etel U E T W R = etel U E T2 W R $ by weaken [k2]
b5: $ G , x ∊ sarg U E T W R , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel U E T W R ∧ x ∈ a ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel U E T2 W R $ by wcel_eq_r [b4, b2]
b6: $ G , x ∊ sarg U E T W R , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel U E T W R ∧ x ∈ a ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel U E T2 W R ∧ x ∈ a $ by and_intro [b5, b3]
b7: $ G , x ∊ sarg U E T W R , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel U E T W R ∧ x ∈ a ⇒ ∃ a (⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel U E T2 W R ∧ x ∈ a) $ by ex_intro [b6]
b8: $ G , x ∊ sarg U E T W R , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel U E T W R ∧ x ∈ a ⇒ x ∊ sarg U E T2 W R $ by cab_intro [b7]
a3: $ G , x ∊ sarg U E T W R ⇒ x ∊ sarg U E T2 W R $ by ex_elim [a2, b8]
c1: $ G , x ∊ sarg U E T2 W R ⇒ x ∊ sarg U E T2 W R $ by ax
c2: $ G , x ∊ sarg U E T2 W R ⇒ ∃ a (⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel U E T2 W R ∧ x ∈ a) $ by cab_elim [c1]
d1: $ G , x ∊ sarg U E T2 W R , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel U E T2 W R ∧ x ∈ a ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel U E T2 W R ∧ x ∈ a $ by ax
d2: $ G , x ∊ sarg U E T2 W R , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel U E T2 W R ∧ x ∈ a ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel U E T2 W R $ by and_elim_l [d1]
d3: $ G , x ∊ sarg U E T2 W R , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel U E T2 W R ∧ x ∈ a ⇒ x ∈ a $ by and_elim_r [d1]
d4: $ G , x ∊ sarg U E T2 W R , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel U E T2 W R ∧ x ∈ a ⇒ etel U E T2 W R = etel U E T W R $ by weaken [k3]
d5: $ G , x ∊ sarg U E T2 W R , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel U E T2 W R ∧ x ∈ a ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel U E T W R $ by wcel_eq_r [d4, d2]
d6: $ G , x ∊ sarg U E T2 W R , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel U E T2 W R ∧ x ∈ a ⇒ ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel U E T W R ∧ x ∈ a $ by and_intro [d5, d3]
d7: $ G , x ∊ sarg U E T2 W R , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel U E T2 W R ∧ x ∈ a ⇒ ∃ a (⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel U E T W R ∧ x ∈ a) $ by ex_intro [d6]
d8: $ G , x ∊ sarg U E T2 W R , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel U E T2 W R ∧ x ∈ a ⇒ x ∊ sarg U E T W R $ by cab_intro [d7]
c3: $ G , x ∊ sarg U E T2 W R ⇒ x ∊ sarg U E T W R $ by ex_elim [c2, d8]
e1: $ G ⇒ sarg U E T W R = sarg U E T2 W R $ by eq_intro [a3, c3]

--| `apn_scons` with class arguments.
lemma i7_apn_scons_c (G: hyps) (V F S A: class): $ G ⇒ S ∈ fseq V $ > $ G ⇒ isset A $ > $ G ⇒ apn F (scons A S) = ap (apn F S) A $
----
l1: $ G , x = S , x ∊ fseq V , a = A ⇒ x ∊ fseq V $ by ax
l2: $ G , x = S , x ∊ fseq V , a = A ⇒ apn F (scons a x) = ap (apn F x) a $ by apn_scons [l1]
l3: $ G , x = S , x ∊ fseq V , a = A ⇒ x = S $ by ax
l4: $ G , x = S , x ∊ fseq V , a = A ⇒ a = A $ by ax
l5: $ G , x = S , x ∊ fseq V , a = A ⇒ F = F $ by eq_refl
l6: $ G , x = S , x ∊ fseq V , a = A ⇒ scons a x = scons A S $ by scons_eq [l4, l3]
l7: $ G , x = S , x ∊ fseq V , a = A ⇒ apn F (scons a x) = apn F (scons A S) $ by apn_eq [l5, l6]
l8: $ G , x = S , x ∊ fseq V , a = A ⇒ apn F x = apn F S $ by apn_eq [l5, l3]
l9: $ G , x = S , x ∊ fseq V , a = A ⇒ ap (apn F x) a = ap (apn F S) A $ by ap_eq [l8, l4]
l10: $ G , x = S , x ∊ fseq V , a = A ⇒ apn F (scons A S) = apn F (scons a x) $ by eq_sym [l7]
l11: $ G , x = S , x ∊ fseq V , a = A ⇒ apn F (scons A S) = ap (apn F x) a $ by eq_trans [l10, l2]
l12: $ G , x = S , x ∊ fseq V , a = A ⇒ apn F (scons A S) = ap (apn F S) A $ by eq_trans [l11, l9]
l13: $ G , x = S , x ∊ fseq V ⇒ apn F (scons A S) = ap (apn F S) A $ by isset_elim [#2, l12]
l14: $ G ⇒ apn F (scons A S) = ap (apn F S) A $ by wcel_elim [#1, l13]

--| The property of the induction for `lrel_rehead_sem`.
def i7_rhp (U M H X W R: class) (.z .e .f: set): class = $ {z | ∀ e ∀ f (ra_rehead H X z e f ∈ lrel → etel U (dnf U M) e W R = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , sarg U (dnf U M) e W R ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ sarg U (dnf U M) e W R ∈ fseq i7_V ∧ dt U M f W R = apn (dt U M X W R) (sarg U (dnf U M) e W R))} $

lemma i7_rh_c1 (G: hyps) (M K S: class) (u w r h t2 y e f x4 x5: set): $ G ⇒ h = ⟨ K , S ⟩ $ > $ G ⇒ ⟨ K , S ⟩ ∈ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ ¬ K = kc_pi $ > $ G ⇒ ¬ K = kc_app $ > $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ r ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ ra_rehead h t2 y e f ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ (h = x4 ∧ t2 = x5 ∧ y = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = x4 ∧ f = x5) → etel u (dnf u M) e w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , sarg u (dnf u M) e w r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ sarg u (dnf u M) e w r ∈ fseq i7_V ∧ dt u M f w r = apn (dt u M t2 w r) (sarg u (dnf u M) e w r) $
----
a0: $ G , h = x4 ∧ t2 = x5 ∧ y = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = x4 ∧ f = x5 ⇒ h = x4 ∧ t2 = x5 ∧ y = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = x4 ∧ f = x5 $ by ax
a1: $ G , h = x4 ∧ t2 = x5 ∧ y = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = x4 ∧ f = x5 ⇒ h = x4 $ by and_elim_l [a0]
a2: $ G , h = x4 ∧ t2 = x5 ∧ y = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = x4 ∧ f = x5 ⇒ t2 = x5 ∧ y = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = x4 ∧ f = x5 $ by and_elim_r [a0]
a3: $ G , h = x4 ∧ t2 = x5 ∧ y = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = x4 ∧ f = x5 ⇒ t2 = x5 $ by and_elim_l [a2]
a4: $ G , h = x4 ∧ t2 = x5 ∧ y = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = x4 ∧ f = x5 ⇒ y = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = x4 ∧ f = x5 $ by and_elim_r [a2]
a5: $ G , h = x4 ∧ t2 = x5 ∧ y = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = x4 ∧ f = x5 ⇒ y = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ $ by and_elim_l [a4]
a6: $ G , h = x4 ∧ t2 = x5 ∧ y = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = x4 ∧ f = x5 ⇒ e = x4 ∧ f = x5 $ by and_elim_r [a4]
a7: $ G , h = x4 ∧ t2 = x5 ∧ y = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = x4 ∧ f = x5 ⇒ e = x4 $ by and_elim_l [a6]
a8: $ G , h = x4 ∧ t2 = x5 ∧ y = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = x4 ∧ f = x5 ⇒ f = x5 $ by and_elim_r [a6]
b0: $ G , h = x4 ∧ t2 = x5 ∧ y = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = x4 ∧ f = x5 ⇒ ra_rehead h t2 y e f ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#7]
b1: $ G , h = x4 ∧ t2 = x5 ∧ y = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = x4 ∧ f = x5 ⇒ h ∊ trees ω ∧ t2 ∊ trees ω ∧ y ∊ trees ω ∧ e ∊ trees ω ∧ f ∊ trees ω $ by i7_rh_args [b0]
b2: $ G , h = x4 ∧ t2 = x5 ∧ y = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = x4 ∧ f = x5 ⇒ t2 ∊ trees ω ∧ y ∊ trees ω ∧ e ∊ trees ω ∧ f ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_r [b1]
b3: $ G , h = x4 ∧ t2 = x5 ∧ y = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = x4 ∧ f = x5 ⇒ y ∊ trees ω ∧ e ∊ trees ω ∧ f ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_r [b2]
b4: $ G , h = x4 ∧ t2 = x5 ∧ y = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = x4 ∧ f = x5 ⇒ e ∊ trees ω ∧ f ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_r [b3]
b5: $ G , h = x4 ∧ t2 = x5 ∧ y = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = x4 ∧ f = x5 ⇒ e ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_l [b4]
d1: $ G , h = x4 ∧ t2 = x5 ∧ y = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = x4 ∧ f = x5 ⇒ x4 = e $ by eq_sym [a7]
