lemma i7_rh_c2 (G: hyps) (M: class) (u w r h t2 k j y e f x4 x5 x6 x7 x8 x9: set): $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ r ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ ra_rehead h t2 y e f ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ crn j ⊆ i7_rhp u M h t2 w r $ > $ G ⇒ y = ⟨ k , j ⟩ $ > $ G ⇒ (h = x4 ∧ t2 = x5 ∧ y = ⟨ kc_s , scons x9 ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = ⟨ kc_app , scons x6 (scons x8 ∅) ⟩ ∧ f = ⟨ kc_app , scons x7 (scons x8 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_rehead x4 x5 x9 x6 x7 ∈ lrel) → etel u (dnf u M) e w r = csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , sarg u (dnf u M) e w r ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∧ sarg u (dnf u M) e w r ∈ fseq i7_V ∧ dt u M f w r = apn (dt u M t2 w r) (sarg u (dnf u M) e w r) $
----
a0: $ G , h = x4 ∧ t2 = x5 ∧ y = ⟨ kc_s , scons x9 ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = ⟨ kc_app , scons x6 (scons x8 ∅) ⟩ ∧ f = ⟨ kc_app , scons x7 (scons x8 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_rehead x4 x5 x9 x6 x7 ∈ lrel ⇒ h = x4 ∧ t2 = x5 ∧ y = ⟨ kc_s , scons x9 ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = ⟨ kc_app , scons x6 (scons x8 ∅) ⟩ ∧ f = ⟨ kc_app , scons x7 (scons x8 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_rehead x4 x5 x9 x6 x7 ∈ lrel $ by ax
