g3: $ G , l = ω , k ∊ l ∧ j ∊ fseq (trees l) ∧ o = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , c = ccom (etf u E) j , z = ⟨ x1 , q ⟩ , z ∊ ap (etb u E k j c) x0 , d = ⟨ x0 , z ⟩ , d ∊ etb u E k j c ⇒ d = ⟨ x0 , z ⟩ $ by ax
g4: $ G , l = ω , k ∊ l ∧ j ∊ fseq (trees l) ∧ o = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , c = ccom (etf u E) j , z = ⟨ x1 , q ⟩ , z ∊ ap (etb u E k j c) x0 , d = ⟨ x0 , z ⟩ , d ∊ etb u E k j c ⇒ z = ⟨ x1 , q ⟩ $ by ax
h1a: $ G , l = ω , k ∊ l ∧ j ∊ fseq (trees l) ∧ o = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , c = ccom (etf u E) j , z = ⟨ x1 , q ⟩ , z ∊ ap (etb u E k j c) x0 , d = ⟨ x0 , z ⟩ , d ∊ etb u E k j c , k = kc_pi ∧ d ∊ clam w lvals (clam r (fseq u) {y | ∃ x ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a (x ∊ da (fv E (fv j ∅)) w r ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da (fv c (suc ∅)) w (scons x r) ∧ y = ⟨ ssnoc f x , ⟨ scons x g , ⟨ scons (da (fv c ∅) w r) t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)}) ⇒ k = kc_pi ∧ d ∊ clam w lvals (clam r (fseq u) {y | ∃ x ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ a (x ∊ da (fv E (fv j ∅)) w r ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da (fv c (suc ∅)) w (scons x r) ∧ y = ⟨ ssnoc f x , ⟨ scons x g , ⟨ scons (da (fv c ∅) w r) t , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)}) $ by ax
