h2c: $ G , l = ω , k ∊ l ∧ j ∊ fseq (trees l) ∧ o = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , c = ccom (etf u E) j , z = ⟨ x1 , q ⟩ , z ∊ ap (etb u E k j c) x0 , d = ⟨ x0 , z ⟩ , d ∊ etb u E k j c , k = kc_app ∧ d ∊ clam w lvals (clam r (fseq u) {y | ∃ a (⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ da (fv c ∅) w r ∧ y = ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , scons (da (fv E (fv j (suc ∅))) w r) a ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)}) ⇒ d = ⟨ x0 , z ⟩ $ by weaken [g3]
