h3e: $ G , l = ω , k ∊ l ∧ j ∊ fseq (trees l) ∧ o = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , c = ccom (etf u E) j , z = ⟨ x1 , q ⟩ , z ∊ ap (etb u E k j c) x0 , d = ⟨ x0 , z ⟩ , d ∊ etb u E k j c , ¬ k = kc_pi ∧ ¬ k = kc_app ∧ d ∊ clam w lvals (clam r (fseq u) (csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)) ⇒ ¬ k = kc_app ∧ d ∊ clam w lvals (clam r (fseq u) (csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)) $ by and_elim_r [h3a]
h3b: $ G , l = ω , k ∊ l ∧ j ∊ fseq (trees l) ∧ o = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , c = ccom (etf u E) j , z = ⟨ x1 , q ⟩ , z ∊ ap (etb u E k j c) x0 , d = ⟨ x0 , z ⟩ , d ∊ etb u E k j c , ¬ k = kc_pi ∧ ¬ k = kc_app ∧ d ∊ clam w lvals (clam r (fseq u) (csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)) ⇒ d ∊ clam w lvals (clam r (fseq u) (csn ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ⟨ ∅ , ∅ ⟩ ⟩ ⟩)) $ by and_elim_r [h3e]
