c0: $ G , z = scons x y , ra_sinst t1 j t3 t4 e f ∈ lrel , j ∊ trees ω , nadd (fv nvf j) (cdm z) = fv nvf t3 , ∀ i ∀ b (i ∊ cdm z → b ∊ trees ω → fv nvf b = nadd (fv nvf j) i → dt u M ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons t1 (scons b ∅) ⟩ w ∅ = fv z i) ⇒ (∃ x0 ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 (t1 = x0 ∧ j = x1 ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ t4 = x2 ∧ e = x3 ∧ f = x3)) ∨ ∃ x0 ∃ x4 ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (t1 = x0 ∧ j = x4 ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ t4 = x2 ∧ e = x3 ∧ f = x6 ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ x1 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_inst x2 x3 ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons x0 (scons x4 ∅) ⟩ x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x0 ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ x1 x2 x5 x6 ∈ lrel) $ by lrel_sinst_cases [c1]
a1: $ G , z = scons x y , ra_sinst t1 j t3 t4 e f ∈ lrel , j ∊ trees ω , nadd (fv nvf j) (cdm z) = fv nvf t3 , ∀ i ∀ b (i ∊ cdm z → b ∊ trees ω → fv nvf b = nadd (fv nvf j) i → dt u M ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons t1 (scons b ∅) ⟩ w ∅ = fv z i) ⇒ (t1 = x0 ∧ j = x1 ∧ t3 = x1 ∧ t4 = x2 ∧ e = x3 ∧ f = x3) → dt u M f w (scat p s) = dt u M e w (scat p (scat z s)) $ by i7_si_s1 [c2, h7, c4]
