h1: $ G , k ∊ ω , g ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn g ⊆ i7_pip u M w s , y = ⟨ k , g ⟩ , y ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr , ra_pinst x1 y x2 x4 ∈ lrel , l ∊ fseq u , cdm l = fv nvf x1 ⇒ uadm u $ by weaken [#2]
h2: $ G , k ∊ ω , g ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn g ⊆ i7_pip u M w s , y = ⟨ k , g ⟩ , y ∊ ofsort lsig lopen ks_expr , ra_pinst x1 y x2 x4 ∈ lrel , l ∊ fseq u , cdm l = fv nvf x1 ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by weaken [#5]
