lemma i7_qi_step (G: hyps) (M: class) (u w t1 t2 s k g y j a r v: set): $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ s ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ crn g ⊆ i7_qip u M t1 t2 w s $ > $ G ⇒ y = ⟨ k , g ⟩ $ > $ G ⇒ ra_qinst t1 t2 y j a r ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ v ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ cdm v = fv nvf y $ > $ G ⇒ i7_qih u M t1 t2 w s v j y $ > $ G ⇒ dt u M r w s = dt u M a w (scat v s) $
----
c0: $ G ⇒ (∃ x0 ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 (t1 = x0 ∧ t2 = x1 ∧ y = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ j = x3 ∧ a = x2 ∧ r = x2)) ∨ ∃ x0 ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x3 (t1 = x0 ∧ t2 = x1 ∧ y = ⟨ kc_s , scons x6 ∅ ⟩ ∧ j = x3 ∧ a = x2 ∧ r = x5 ∧ ra_inst x6 x2 ⟨ kc_proj , scons x0 (scons x3 (scons x1 ∅)) ⟩ x4 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_qinst x0 x1 x6 ⟨ kc_s , scons x3 ∅ ⟩ x4 x5 ∈ lrel) $ by lrel_qinst_cases [#5]
