s1: $ G , k ∊ ω , g ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn g ⊆ i7_qip u M t1 t2 w s , y = ⟨ k , g ⟩ , ra_qinst t1 t2 y x6 x7 x8 ∈ lrel , x9 ∊ fseq u , cdm x9 = fv nvf y , ∀ i ∀ b (i ∊ cdm x9 → b ∊ trees ω → nadd (fv nvf b) (suc i) = nadd (fv nvf x6) (fv nvf y) → dt u M ⟨ kc_proj , scons t1 (scons b (scons t2 ∅)) ⟩ w s = fv x9 i) ⇒ crn g ⊆ i7_qip u M t1 t2 w s $ by ax
s2: $ G , k ∊ ω , g ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn g ⊆ i7_qip u M t1 t2 w s , y = ⟨ k , g ⟩ , ra_qinst t1 t2 y x6 x7 x8 ∈ lrel , x9 ∊ fseq u , cdm x9 = fv nvf y , ∀ i ∀ b (i ∊ cdm x9 → b ∊ trees ω → nadd (fv nvf b) (suc i) = nadd (fv nvf x6) (fv nvf y) → dt u M ⟨ kc_proj , scons t1 (scons b (scons t2 ∅)) ⟩ w s = fv x9 i) ⇒ y = ⟨ k , g ⟩ $ by ax
s3: $ G , k ∊ ω , g ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn g ⊆ i7_qip u M t1 t2 w s , y = ⟨ k , g ⟩ , ra_qinst t1 t2 y x6 x7 x8 ∈ lrel , x9 ∊ fseq u , cdm x9 = fv nvf y , ∀ i ∀ b (i ∊ cdm x9 → b ∊ trees ω → nadd (fv nvf b) (suc i) = nadd (fv nvf x6) (fv nvf y) → dt u M ⟨ kc_proj , scons t1 (scons b (scons t2 ∅)) ⟩ w s = fv x9 i) ⇒ ra_qinst t1 t2 y x6 x7 x8 ∈ lrel $ by ax
s3a: $ G , k ∊ ω , g ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn g ⊆ i7_qip u M t1 t2 w s , y = ⟨ k , g ⟩ , ra_qinst t1 t2 y x6 x7 x8 ∈ lrel , x9 ∊ fseq u , cdm x9 = fv nvf y , ∀ i ∀ b (i ∊ cdm x9 → b ∊ trees ω → nadd (fv nvf b) (suc i) = nadd (fv nvf x6) (fv nvf y) → dt u M ⟨ kc_proj , scons t1 (scons b (scons t2 ∅)) ⟩ w s = fv x9 i) ⇒ x9 ∊ fseq u $ by ax
s3b: $ G , k ∊ ω , g ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn g ⊆ i7_qip u M t1 t2 w s , y = ⟨ k , g ⟩ , ra_qinst t1 t2 y x6 x7 x8 ∈ lrel , x9 ∊ fseq u , cdm x9 = fv nvf y , ∀ i ∀ b (i ∊ cdm x9 → b ∊ trees ω → nadd (fv nvf b) (suc i) = nadd (fv nvf x6) (fv nvf y) → dt u M ⟨ kc_proj , scons t1 (scons b (scons t2 ∅)) ⟩ w s = fv x9 i) ⇒ cdm x9 = fv nvf y $ by ax
s3c: $ G , k ∊ ω , g ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn g ⊆ i7_qip u M t1 t2 w s , y = ⟨ k , g ⟩ , ra_qinst t1 t2 y x6 x7 x8 ∈ lrel , x9 ∊ fseq u , cdm x9 = fv nvf y , ∀ i ∀ b (i ∊ cdm x9 → b ∊ trees ω → nadd (fv nvf b) (suc i) = nadd (fv nvf x6) (fv nvf y) → dt u M ⟨ kc_proj , scons t1 (scons b (scons t2 ∅)) ⟩ w s = fv x9 i) ⇒ ∀ i ∀ b (i ∊ cdm x9 → b ∊ trees ω → nadd (fv nvf b) (suc i) = nadd (fv nvf x6) (fv nvf y) → dt u M ⟨ kc_proj , scons t1 (scons b (scons t2 ∅)) ⟩ w s = fv x9 i) $ by ax
s3d: $ G , k ∊ ω , g ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn g ⊆ i7_qip u M t1 t2 w s , y = ⟨ k , g ⟩ , ra_qinst t1 t2 y x6 x7 x8 ∈ lrel , x9 ∊ fseq u , cdm x9 = fv nvf y , ∀ i ∀ b (i ∊ cdm x9 → b ∊ trees ω → nadd (fv nvf b) (suc i) = nadd (fv nvf x6) (fv nvf y) → dt u M ⟨ kc_proj , scons t1 (scons b (scons t2 ∅)) ⟩ w s = fv x9 i) ⇒ i7_qih u M t1 t2 w s x9 x6 y $ by i7_id [s3c]
s3e: $ G , k ∊ ω , g ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn g ⊆ i7_qip u M t1 t2 w s , y = ⟨ k , g ⟩ , ra_qinst t1 t2 y x6 x7 x8 ∈ lrel , x9 ∊ fseq u , cdm x9 = fv nvf y , ∀ i ∀ b (i ∊ cdm x9 → b ∊ trees ω → nadd (fv nvf b) (suc i) = nadd (fv nvf x6) (fv nvf y) → dt u M ⟨ kc_proj , scons t1 (scons b (scons t2 ∅)) ⟩ w s = fv x9 i) ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by weaken [#4]
s3f: $ G , k ∊ ω , g ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn g ⊆ i7_qip u M t1 t2 w s , y = ⟨ k , g ⟩ , ra_qinst t1 t2 y x6 x7 x8 ∈ lrel , x9 ∊ fseq u , cdm x9 = fv nvf y , ∀ i ∀ b (i ∊ cdm x9 → b ∊ trees ω → nadd (fv nvf b) (suc i) = nadd (fv nvf x6) (fv nvf y) → dt u M ⟨ kc_proj , scons t1 (scons b (scons t2 ∅)) ⟩ w s = fv x9 i) ⇒ s ∊ fseq u $ by weaken [#5]
s4: $ G , k ∊ ω , g ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn g ⊆ i7_qip u M t1 t2 w s , y = ⟨ k , g ⟩ , ra_qinst t1 t2 y x6 x7 x8 ∈ lrel , x9 ∊ fseq u , cdm x9 = fv nvf y , ∀ i ∀ b (i ∊ cdm x9 → b ∊ trees ω → nadd (fv nvf b) (suc i) = nadd (fv nvf x6) (fv nvf y) → dt u M ⟨ kc_proj , scons t1 (scons b (scons t2 ∅)) ⟩ w s = fv x9 i) ⇒ dt u M x8 w s = dt u M x7 w (scat x9 s) $ by i7_qi_step [s3e, s3f, s1, s2, s3, s3a, s3b, s3d]
s5a: $ G , k ∊ ω , g ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn g ⊆ i7_qip u M t1 t2 w s , y = ⟨ k , g ⟩ , ra_qinst t1 t2 y x6 x7 x8 ∈ lrel , x9 ∊ fseq u , cdm x9 = fv nvf y ⇒ ∀ i ∀ b (i ∊ cdm x9 → b ∊ trees ω → nadd (fv nvf b) (suc i) = nadd (fv nvf x6) (fv nvf y) → dt u M ⟨ kc_proj , scons t1 (scons b (scons t2 ∅)) ⟩ w s = fv x9 i) → dt u M x8 w s = dt u M x7 w (scat x9 s) $ by imp_intro [s4]
