c1ag: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i8_iae u M w t1 t3 r r2 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_iargs t1 m t3 z ∈ lrel , t1 = x1 ∧ m = ⟨ kc_s , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_app , scons x4 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_iargs x1 x2 x3 x4 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x1 x5 ∈ lrel ⇒ ∀ i (i ∊ fv nvf t1 → fv r i = fv r2 i) $ by weaken [#6]
c1g: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i8_iae u M w t1 t3 r r2 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_iargs t1 m t3 z ∈ lrel , t1 = x1 ∧ m = ⟨ kc_s , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_app , scons x4 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_iargs x1 x2 x3 x4 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x1 x5 ∈ lrel ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w r = etel u (dnf u M) z w r2 $ by i8_iae_step [c1cj, c1zk, c1l0, c1l2, c1l3, c1l4, c1r4, c1w, c1q, c1q2, c1ag]
c1x4: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i8_iae u M w t1 t3 r r2 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_iargs t1 m t3 z ∈ lrel , ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ m = ⟨ kc_s , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_app , scons x4 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_iargs x1 x2 x3 x4 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x1 x5 ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ m = ⟨ kc_s , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_app , scons x4 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_iargs x1 x2 x3 x4 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x1 x5 ∈ lrel) $ by ax
c1f4: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i8_iae u M w t1 t3 r r2 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_iargs t1 m t3 z ∈ lrel , ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ m = ⟨ kc_s , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_app , scons x4 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_iargs x1 x2 x3 x4 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x1 x5 ∈ lrel) ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w r = etel u (dnf u M) z w r2 $ by ex_elim [c1x4, c1g]
c1x3: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i8_iae u M w t1 t3 r r2 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_iargs t1 m t3 z ∈ lrel , ∃ x4 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ m = ⟨ kc_s , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_app , scons x4 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_iargs x1 x2 x3 x4 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x1 x5 ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x4 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ m = ⟨ kc_s , scons x2 ∅ ⟩ ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_app , scons x4 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_iargs x1 x2 x3 x4 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x1 x5 ∈ lrel) $ by ax
