cl1: $ G , t1 = x0 ∧ t2 = x1 ∧ t3 = x2 ∧ t4 = x3 ∧ t5 = a ∧ t6 = x4 ∧ ra_spine ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x6 ∅ ⟩ a x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x3 x2 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x5 x4 x6 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_le ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ x1 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pargs ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x6 ∅ ⟩ x3 x2 x9 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nidx x0 x4 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_iargs x5 x7 x9 a ∈ lrel , h = ⟨ kc_bvar , scons x6 ∅ ⟩ ⇒ t2 = x1 $ by and_elim_l [cr0]
