m7: $ G , v ∊ etel u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons A (scons B ∅) ⟩ w r , ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ c (x ∊ dt u M A w r ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , c ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) B w (scons x r) ∧ v = ⟨ ssnoc f x , ⟨ scons x g , ⟨ scons (etel u (dnf u M) A w r) t , c ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ f ∃ g ∃ t ∃ c (x ∊ dt u M A w r ∧ x ∊ u ∧ ⟨ f , ⟨ g , ⟨ t , c ⟩ ⟩ ⟩ ∈ etel u (dnf u M) B w (scons x r) ∧ v = ⟨ ssnoc f x , ⟨ scons x g , ⟨ scons (etel u (dnf u M) A w r) t , c ⟩ ⟩ ⟩) $ by ax
