m10: $ G ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons A (scons B ∅) ⟩ w r ⊆ etel u (dnf u M) ⟨ kc_pi , scons A (scons B ∅) ⟩ w s $ by subset_intro [m9]

--| `lrel_ipos_etel`, the case `ipos_closed`.
lemma i9_pe_c1 {i x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x7: set} (G: hyps) (M: class) (u w a b t1 t2 t3 d z: set): $ G ⇒ z ∊ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ a ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ b ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) $ > $ G ⇒ (∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x7 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel)) → etel u (dnf u M) z w a = etel u (dnf u M) z w b $
----
b0: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ⇒ t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel $ by ax
b1: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ⇒ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [b0]
b2: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ⇒ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [b1]
b3: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ⇒ t3 = x3 $ by and_elim_l [b2]
b4: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ⇒ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [b2]
b5: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ⇒ d = x4 $ by and_elim_l [b4]
b6: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ⇒ z = x5 ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [b4]
b7: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ⇒ z = x5 $ by and_elim_l [b6]
b8: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [b6]
b9: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_l [b8]
b10: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [b8]
l1: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ⇒ nvf = nvf $ by eq_refl
l2: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ⇒ fv nvf d = fv nvf x4 $ by fv_eq [l1, b5]
