l12: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) x5 w a = etel u (dnf u M) x5 w b $ by lrel_closed_etel [b10, l11, l12a, l12b, l12c, l10]
