--| `lrel_ipos_etel`, the case `ipos_app`.
lemma i9_pe_c3 {i x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8: set} (G: hyps) (M: class) (u w a b t1 t2 t3 d z: set): $ G ⇒ z ∊ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ a ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ b ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) $ > $ G ⇒ (∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel)) → etel u (dnf u M) z w a = etel u (dnf u M) z w b $
----
b0: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel $ by ax
b1: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [b0]
b2: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [b1]
b3: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ t3 = x3 $ by and_elim_l [b2]
b4: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [b2]
b5: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ d = x4 $ by and_elim_l [b4]
b6: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [b4]
b7: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ z = x5 $ by and_elim_l [b6]
b10: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [b6]
l1: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ nvf = nvf $ by eq_refl
l2: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ fv nvf d = fv nvf x4 $ by fv_eq [l1, b5]
l3: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ fv nvf t3 = fv nvf x3 $ by fv_eq [l1, b3]
l4: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) = nadd (fv nvf x4) (fv nvf x3) $ by nadd_eq [l2, l3]
l8: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ a = a $ by eq_refl
l9: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ b = b $ by eq_refl
l10a: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) $ by weaken [#5]
l10: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf x4) (fv nvf x3) → fv a i = fv b i) $ by i9_agr [l4, l8, l9, l10a]
l11a: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ z ∊ trees ω $ by weaken [#1]
l11: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ x5 ∊ trees ω $ by welc_eq_set [b7, l11a]
l12a: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by weaken [#2]
l12b: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ a ∊ fseq u $ by weaken [#3]
l12c: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ b ∊ fseq u $ by weaken [#4]
l12: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) x5 w a = etel u (dnf u M) x5 w b $ by lrel_indapp_etel [b10, l11, l12a, l12b, l12c, l10]
l13: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ x5 = z $ by eq_sym [b7]
l14: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ w = w $ by eq_refl
l15: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w a = etel u (dnf u M) x5 w a $ by etel_eq [b7, l14, l8]
l16: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) x5 w b = etel u (dnf u M) z w b $ by etel_eq [l13, l14, l9]
l17: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w a = etel u (dnf u M) x5 w b $ by eq_trans [l15, l12]
l18: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w a = etel u (dnf u M) z w b $ by eq_trans [l17, l16]
e1: $ G , ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) $ by ax
e2: $ G , ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w a = etel u (dnf u M) z w b $ by ex_elim [e1, l18]
e3: $ G , ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) $ by ax
e4: $ G , ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w a = etel u (dnf u M) z w b $ by ex_elim [e3, e2]
e5: $ G , ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) $ by ax
e6: $ G , ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w a = etel u (dnf u M) z w b $ by ex_elim [e5, e4]
e7: $ G , ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) $ by ax
e8: $ G , ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w a = etel u (dnf u M) z w b $ by ex_elim [e7, e6]
e9: $ G , ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) $ by ax
e10: $ G , ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w a = etel u (dnf u M) z w b $ by ex_elim [e9, e8]
e11: $ G , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) $ by ax
e12: $ G , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w a = etel u (dnf u M) z w b $ by ex_elim [e11, e10]
e13: $ G ⇒ (∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel)) → etel u (dnf u M) z w a = etel u (dnf u M) z w b $ by imp_intro [e12]

--| The step of `lrel_ipos_etel` at `ipos_pi`: the codomain's paths at `v :: a`, `v :: b`.
lemma i9_pe_st {i v: set} (G: hyps) (M: class) (u w a b t1 t2 t3 d x1 x2 x3 x4 x6: set): $ G ⇒ t1 = x1 $ > $ G ⇒ t2 = x2 $ > $ G ⇒ t3 = x3 $ > $ G ⇒ d = x4 $ > $ G ⇒ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ x6 ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ x6 ∊ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 $ > $ G ⇒ d ∊ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ a ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ b ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) $ > $ G ⇒ ∀ v (v ∊ u → etel u (dnf u M) x6 w (scons v a) ⊆ etel u (dnf u M) x6 w (scons v b)) ∧ ∀ v (v ∊ u → etel u (dnf u M) x6 w (scons v b) ⊆ etel u (dnf u M) x6 w (scons v a)) $
----
q0: $ G ⇒ x4 = d $ by eq_sym [#4]
q1a: $ G ⇒ kc_s = kc_s $ by eq_refl
q1b: $ G ⇒ ∅ = ∅ $ by eq_refl
q1c: $ G ⇒ scons x4 ∅ = scons d ∅ $ by scons_eq [q0, q1b]
q1: $ G ⇒ ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ = ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ $ by opair_eq [q1a, q1c]
q2a: $ G ⇒ x1 = t1 $ by eq_sym [#1]
q2b: $ G ⇒ x2 = t2 $ by eq_sym [#2]
q2c: $ G ⇒ x3 = t3 $ by eq_sym [#3]
q2d: $ G ⇒ x6 = x6 $ by eq_refl
q2: $ G ⇒ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ x6 = ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ x6 $ by ra_ipos_eq [q2a, q2b, q2c, q1, q2d]
q3: $ G ⇒ ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ x6 ∈ lrel $ by wcel_eq_l [q2, #5]
q4a: $ G ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
q4b: $ G ⇒ kc_s ∈ ω $ by kc_s_omega
q4c: $ G ⇒ d ∈ trees ω $ by welc_wcel [#7]
q4d: $ G ⇒ ∅ ∈ fseq (trees ω) $ by fseq_empty
q4e: $ G ⇒ scons d ∅ ∈ fseq (trees ω) $ by scons_fseq_c [q4c, q4d]
q4: $ G ⇒ ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ ∈ trees ω $ by trees_intro_c [q4a, q4b, q4e]
q7a: $ G ⇒ fv nvf ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ = suc (fv nvf d) $ by nvf_s [q4c]
q7b: $ G ⇒ fv nvf t3 = fv nvf t3 $ by eq_refl
q7c: $ G ⇒ nadd (fv nvf ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩) (fv nvf t3) = nadd (suc (fv nvf d)) (fv nvf t3) $ by nadd_eq [q7a, q7b]
q7d0: $ G ⇒ functional nvf $ by nvf_functional
q7d: $ G ⇒ isset (fv nvf d) $ by fv_set [q7d0]
q7e: $ G ⇒ isset t3 $ by isset_var
q7f: $ G ⇒ fv nvf t3 ∈ ω $ by nvf_omega [q7e]
q7g: $ G ⇒ nadd (suc (fv nvf d)) (fv nvf t3) = suc (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) $ by suc_nadd_c [q7d, q7f]
q7h: $ G ⇒ nadd (fv nvf ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩) (fv nvf t3) = suc (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) $ by eq_trans [q7c, q7g]
q7i: $ G ⇒ suc (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) = nadd (fv nvf ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩) (fv nvf t3) $ by eq_sym [q7h]
q7j: $ G ⇒ isset d $ by isset_var
q7k: $ G ⇒ fv nvf d ∈ ω $ by nvf_omega [q7j]
q7l: $ G ⇒ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) ∈ ω $ by nadd_omega_c [q7k, q7f]
v1: $ G , v ∊ u ⇒ v ∊ u $ by ax
v2: $ G , v ∊ u ⇒ a ∊ fseq u $ by weaken [#8]
v3: $ G , v ∊ u ⇒ b ∊ fseq u $ by weaken [#9]
v4: $ G , v ∊ u ⇒ scons v a ∈ fseq u $ by scons_fseq [v1, v2]
v5: $ G , v ∊ u ⇒ scons v b ∈ fseq u $ by scons_fseq [v1, v3]
v6: $ G , v ∊ u ⇒ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) ∈ ω $ by weaken [q7l]
v7: $ G , v ∊ u ⇒ ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) $ by weaken [#10]
v8: $ G , v ∊ u ⇒ ∀ i (i ∊ suc (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) → fv (scons v a) i = fv (scons v b) i) $ by scons_agree [v6, v7]
v9: $ G , v ∊ u ⇒ suc (nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3)) = nadd (fv nvf ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩) (fv nvf t3) $ by weaken [q7i]
v10: $ G , v ∊ u ⇒ scons v a = scons v a $ by eq_refl
v11: $ G , v ∊ u ⇒ scons v b = scons v b $ by eq_refl
v12: $ G , v ∊ u ⇒ ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩) (fv nvf t3) → fv (scons v a) i = fv (scons v b) i) $ by i9_agr [v9, v10, v11, v8]
v13: $ G , v ∊ u ⇒ x6 ∊ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 $ by weaken [#6]
v14: $ G , v ∊ u ⇒ ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ x6 ∈ lrel $ by weaken [q3]
v15: $ G , v ∊ u ⇒ ⟨ kc_s , scons d ∅ ⟩ ∈ trees ω $ by weaken [q4]
v16: $ G , v ∊ u ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) x6 w (scons v a) = etel u (dnf u M) x6 w (scons v b) $ by i9_pe_e [v13, v14, v15, v4, v5, v12]
v17: $ G , v ∊ u ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) x6 w (scons v a) ⊆ etel u (dnf u M) x6 w (scons v b) $ by eq_subset [v16]
v18: $ G , v ∊ u ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) x6 w (scons v b) = etel u (dnf u M) x6 w (scons v a) $ by eq_sym [v16]
v19: $ G , v ∊ u ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) x6 w (scons v b) ⊆ etel u (dnf u M) x6 w (scons v a) $ by eq_subset [v18]
w1: $ G ⇒ v ∊ u → etel u (dnf u M) x6 w (scons v a) ⊆ etel u (dnf u M) x6 w (scons v b) $ by imp_intro [v17]
w2: $ G ⇒ v ∊ u → etel u (dnf u M) x6 w (scons v b) ⊆ etel u (dnf u M) x6 w (scons v a) $ by imp_intro [v19]
w3: $ G ⇒ ∀ v (v ∊ u → etel u (dnf u M) x6 w (scons v a) ⊆ etel u (dnf u M) x6 w (scons v b)) $ by all_intro [w1]
w4: $ G ⇒ ∀ v (v ∊ u → etel u (dnf u M) x6 w (scons v b) ⊆ etel u (dnf u M) x6 w (scons v a)) $ by all_intro [w2]
w5: $ G ⇒ ∀ v (v ∊ u → etel u (dnf u M) x6 w (scons v a) ⊆ etel u (dnf u M) x6 w (scons v b)) ∧ ∀ v (v ∊ u → etel u (dnf u M) x6 w (scons v b) ⊆ etel u (dnf u M) x6 w (scons v a)) $ by and_intro [w3, w4]

--| `lrel_ipos_etel`, the case `ipos_pi`.
lemma i9_pe_c2 {i x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x6 x7: set} (G: hyps) (M: class) (u w a b t1 t2 t3 d z k j: set): $ G ⇒ crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 $ > $ G ⇒ z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ $ > $ G ⇒ z ∊ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ d ∊ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ a ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ b ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) $ > $ G ⇒ (∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x7 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x5 (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ x6 ∈ lrel)) → etel u (dnf u M) z w a = etel u (dnf u M) z w b $
----
b0: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x5 (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ x6 ∈ lrel ⇒ t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x5 (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ x6 ∈ lrel $ by ax
