s1: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) ⇒ k ∊ ω $ by ax
s2: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) $ by ax
s3: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) ⇒ z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ $ by ax
s4: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) ⇒ z ∊ trees ω $ by i9_ztree [s1, s2, s3]
s5: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by weaken [#4]
s6: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) ⇒ a ∊ fseq u $ by ax
s7: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) ⇒ b ∊ fseq u $ by ax
s8: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) ⇒ ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) $ by ax
s9a: $ _ ⇒ ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) ↔ ∀ m (m ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a m = fv b m) $ by all_alpha
s9b: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) ⇒ ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) ↔ ∀ m (m ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a m = fv b m) $ by weaken [s9a]
s9: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) ⇒ ∀ m (m ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a m = fv b m) $ by bi_elim_l [s9b, s8]
s10: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) ⇒ ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel $ by ax
s11: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) ⇒ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x7 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x7 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x5 (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ x6 ∈ lrel) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) $ by lrel_ipos_cases [s10]
s12: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) ⇒ (∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x7 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel)) → etel u (dnf u M) z w a = etel u (dnf u M) z w b $ by i9_pe_c1 [s4, s5, s6, s7, s9]
s13: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x7 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel) ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w a = etel u (dnf u M) z w b $ by imp_use [s12]
s14: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) ⇒ crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 $ by ax
s15: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) ⇒ d ∊ trees ω $ by ax
s16: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) ⇒ (∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x7 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x5 (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ x6 ∈ lrel)) → etel u (dnf u M) z w a = etel u (dnf u M) z w b $ by i9_pe_c2 [s14, s3, s4, s15, s5, s6, s7, s9]
s17: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x7 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x5 (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ x6 ∈ lrel) ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w a = etel u (dnf u M) z w b $ by imp_use [s16]
s18: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) ⇒ (∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel)) → etel u (dnf u M) z w a = etel u (dnf u M) z w b $ by i9_pe_c3 [s4, s5, s6, s7, s9]
s19: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w a = etel u (dnf u M) z w b $ by imp_use [s18]
s20: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x7 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x5 (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ x6 ∈ lrel) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x7 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x5 (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ x6 ∈ lrel) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) $ by ax
s17w: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x7 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x5 (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ x6 ∈ lrel) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x7 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x5 (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ x6 ∈ lrel) ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w a = etel u (dnf u M) z w b $ by weaken [s17]
s19w: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x7 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x5 (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ x6 ∈ lrel) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w a = etel u (dnf u M) z w b $ by weaken [s19]
s21: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x7 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x5 (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ x6 ∈ lrel) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w a = etel u (dnf u M) z w b $ by or_elim [s20, s17w, s19w]
s22: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) z w a = etel u (dnf u M) z w b $ by or_elim [s11, s13, s21]
s23: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ ⇒ z ∊ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 $ by i9_pe_i [s22]
s24: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ ⇒ z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ $ by ax
s25: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 $ by wcel_intro [s24, s23]
s26: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 ⇒ isset ⟨ k , j ⟩ $ by opair_isset
s27: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 ⇒ ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 $ by isset_elim [s26, s25]
s28: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) ⇒ crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 $ by imp_intro [s27]
s29: $ G , k ∊ ω ⇒ j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 $ by imp_intro [s28]
s30: $ G ⇒ k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 $ by imp_intro [s29]
s31: $ G ⇒ ∀ j (k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3) $ by all_intro [s30]
s32: $ G ⇒ ∀ k ∀ j (k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3) $ by all_intro [s31]
s33: $ G ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
s34: $ G ⇒ trees ω ⊆ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 $ by trees_ind_c [s33, s32]
s35: $ G ⇒ t5 ∊ i9_pe u M w t1 t2 t3 $ by subset_elim [s34, #3]
s36: $ G ⇒ t4 ∈ trees ω $ by welc_wcel [#2]
s37: $ G ⇒ r ∈ fseq u $ by welc_wcel [#5]
s38: $ G ⇒ r2 ∈ fseq u $ by welc_wcel [#6]
s39: $ G ⇒ etel u (dnf u M) t5 w r = etel u (dnf u M) t5 w r2 $ by i9_pe_e [s35, #1, s36, s37, s38, #7]

--| An expression node has the value `∅` off the valuations over `u` (copied from model-meta).
lemma i9_node_out (G: hyps) (M W R K S: class) (u t: set): $ G ⇒ t ∊ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ t = ⟨ K , S ⟩ $ > $ G ⇒ K ∈ kstr $ > $ G ⇒ isset S $ > $ G ⇒ ¬ R ∈ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ dt u M t W R = ∅ $
----
l1: $ G ⇒ isset K $ by wcel_isset [#3]
l2y1: $ G ⇒ ⟨ K , S ⟩ ∈ trees ω $ by wcel_intro [#2, #1]
l2y2: $ G ⇒ isset ω $ by omega_set
l2y3: $ G ⇒ K ∈ ω ∧ S ∈ fseq (trees ω) $ by trees_node_c [l2y2, l2y1, l1, #4]
l2: $ G ⇒ S ∈ fseq (trees ω) $ by and_elim_r [l2y3]
l3: $ G ⇒ dt u M ⟨ K , S ⟩ W R = ∅ $ by dt_out [#3, l2, #5]
l4: $ G ⇒ u = u $ by eq_refl
l5: $ G ⇒ M = M $ by eq_refl
l6: $ G ⇒ W = W $ by eq_refl
l7: $ G ⇒ R = R $ by eq_refl
l8: $ G ⇒ dt u M t W R = dt u M ⟨ K , S ⟩ W R $ by dt_eq [l4, l5, #2, l6, l7]
l9: $ G ⇒ dt u M t W R = ∅ $ by eq_trans [l8, l3]

--| A spine whose head is an expression node is one too.
lemma i9_spine_out (G: hyps) (M W R K S: class) (u e k: set): $ G ⇒ ra_spine ⟨ K , S ⟩ e k ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ K ∈ kstr $ > $ G ⇒ isset S $ > $ G ⇒ e ∊ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ ¬ R ∈ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ dt u M e W R = ∅ $
----
a1: $ G , o = ⟨ K , S ⟩ ⇒ o = ⟨ K , S ⟩ $ by ax
a2: $ G , o = ⟨ K , S ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ K , S ⟩ = o $ by eq_sym [a1]
a3: $ G , o = ⟨ K , S ⟩ ⇒ e = e $ by eq_refl
a4: $ G , o = ⟨ K , S ⟩ ⇒ k = k $ by eq_refl
a5: $ G , o = ⟨ K , S ⟩ ⇒ ra_spine ⟨ K , S ⟩ e k = ra_spine o e k $ by ra_spine_eq [a2, a3, a4]
a6: $ G , o = ⟨ K , S ⟩ ⇒ ra_spine ⟨ K , S ⟩ e k ∈ lrel $ by weaken [#1]
a7: $ G , o = ⟨ K , S ⟩ ⇒ ra_spine o e k ∈ lrel $ by wcel_eq_l [a5, a6]
a8: $ G , o = ⟨ K , S ⟩ ⇒ (∃ x1 (o = x1 ∧ e = x1 ∧ k = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩)) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 (o = x1 ∧ e = ⟨ kc_app , scons x2 (scons x3 ∅) ⟩ ∧ k = ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ ∧ ra_spine x1 x2 x4 ∈ lrel) $ by lrel_spine_cases [a7]
