--| A positive field type is an expression node: `∅` off the valuations over `u`.
lemma i9_ipos_out (G: hyps) (M W R: class) (u t1 t2 t3 t4 t5: set): $ G ⇒ ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 ∈ lrel $ > $ G ⇒ t5 ∊ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ ¬ R ∈ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ dt u M t5 W R = ∅ $
----
a1: $ G ⇒ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x7 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x7 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x5 (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ x6 ∈ lrel) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) $ by lrel_ipos_cases [#1]
a2a: $ G ⇒ u = u $ by eq_refl
a2b: $ G ⇒ M = M $ by eq_refl
a2c: $ G ⇒ W = W $ by eq_refl
a2d: $ G ⇒ R = R $ by eq_refl
