l8: $ G ⇒ ∀ d ∀ a ∀ b (ra_ipos D N Q d y ∈ lrel → d ∊ trees ω → a ∊ fseq u → b ∊ fseq u → ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf Q) → fv a i = fv b i) → ∀ i (fv a i ⊆ fv b i) → dt u M y w a ⊆ dt u M y w b) $ by all_intro [l7]
