c5: $ G , o = Dd , o ∊ trees ω , p = A , p ∊ fseq u , q = B , q ∊ fseq u ⇒ ra_ipos D N Q o y ∈ lrel → o ∊ trees ω → p ∊ fseq u → q ∊ fseq u → ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf o) (fv nvf Q) → fv p i = fv q i) → ∀ i (fv p i ⊆ fv q i) → dt u M y w p ⊆ dt u M y w q $ by all_elim [c4]
