--| `lrel_ipos_mono`, the case `ipos_app`.
lemma i9_pm_c3 {i x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8: set} (G: hyps) (M: class) (u w a b t1 t2 t3 d z: set): $ G ⇒ z ∊ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ a ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ b ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) $ > $ G ⇒ ∀ i (fv a i ⊆ fv b i) $ > $ G ⇒ (∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel)) → dt u M z w a ⊆ dt u M z w b $
----
b0: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel $ by ax
b1: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ t1 = x1 $ by and_elim_l [b0]
br1: $ G , t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel ⇒ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel $ by and_elim_r [b0]
