s20: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pm u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) , ∀ i (fv a i ⊆ fv b i) , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x7 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x5 (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ x6 ∈ lrel) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) ⇒ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x7 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x5 (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ x6 ∈ lrel) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) $ by ax
s17w: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pm u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) , ∀ i (fv a i ⊆ fv b i) , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x7 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x5 (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ x6 ∈ lrel) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x7 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x5 (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ x6 ∈ lrel) ⇒ dt u M z w a ⊆ dt u M z w b $ by weaken [s17]
s19w: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pm u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) , ∀ i (fv a i ⊆ fv b i) , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x7 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x5 (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ x6 ∈ lrel) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) ⇒ dt u M z w a ⊆ dt u M z w b $ by weaken [s19]
s21: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pm u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) , ∀ i (fv a i ⊆ fv b i) , ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x7 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_pi , scons x5 (scons x6 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_add x4 x3 x7 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_closed x7 x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ipos x1 x2 x3 ⟨ kc_s , scons x4 ∅ ⟩ x6 ∈ lrel) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x8 ∃ x5 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ d = x4 ∧ z = x5 ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x8 ∈ lrel) ⇒ dt u M z w a ⊆ dt u M z w b $ by or_elim [s20, s17w, s19w]
s22: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_pm u M w t1 t2 t3 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_ipos t1 t2 t3 d z ∈ lrel , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) , ∀ i (fv a i ⊆ fv b i) ⇒ dt u M z w a ⊆ dt u M z w b $ by or_elim [s11, s13, s21]
