s30: $ G ⇒ k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ i9_pm u M w t1 t2 t3 → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ i9_pm u M w t1 t2 t3 $ by imp_intro [s29]
s31: $ G ⇒ ∀ j (k ∊ ω → j ∊ fseq (trees ω) → crn j ⊆ i9_pm u M w t1 t2 t3 → ⟨ k , j ⟩ ∈ i9_pm u M w t1 t2 t3) $ by all_intro [s30]
