--| `lrel_cwf_mono`, the case `cwf_res`.
lemma i9_cm_c2 {i x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x6 x7 x8 f g l n o p q t x y: set} (G: hyps) (J M: class) (u w a b t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d z: set): $ G ⇒ z ∊ trees ω $ > $ G ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ > $ G ⇒ a ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ b ∊ fseq u $ > $ G ⇒ ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) $ > $ G ⇒ (∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 ∃ f ∃ g ∃ l ∃ n ∃ o ∃ p ∃ q ∃ t ∃ x ∃ y (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ c = x6 ∧ d = x7 ∧ z = f ∧ ra_indapp x1 x2 x3 x7 f x5 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_add x7 x3 x8 ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sinst x1 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x2 x8 f g ∈ lrel ∧ ra_ind_data x1 l n o ∈ lrel ∧ ra_nth_ty o x5 p q ∈ lrel ∧ ra_pis n p t ∈ lrel ∧ ra_lift x8 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ t x ∈ lrel ∧ ra_sty x6 ⟨ kc_ind_ty , scons x1 (scons x5 ∅) ⟩ x g y ∈ lrel3 J)) → etel u (dnf u M) z w a ⊆ etel u (dnf u M) z w b $
----
