s1: $ G , k ∊ ω , j ∊ fseq (trees ω) , crn j ⊆ i9_cm u M w J t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 , z = ⟨ k , j ⟩ , ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 c d z ∈ lrel3 J , d ∊ trees ω , a ∊ fseq u , b ∊ fseq u , ∀ i (i ∊ nadd (fv nvf d) (fv nvf t3) → fv a i = fv b i) , ∀ i (fv a i ⊆ fv b i) ⇒ k ∊ ω $ by ax
