xa2: $ G , ∃ x6 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ t6 = x6 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_tnil , ∅ ⟩) ⇒ ra_ctors_wf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 b ∈ lrel3 J ∧ ra_tys_wf t1 t2 t3 t4 ⟨ kc_s , scons t5 ∅ ⟩ t6 c ∈ lrel3 J $ by ex_elim [xa1, n15]
