xa5: $ G , ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ t6 = x6 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_tnil , ∅ ⟩) ⇒ ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ t6 = x6 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_tnil , ∅ ⟩) $ by ax
