--| Inversion of `ctors_wf` at a `ccons`.
lemma i9_cw_cc (G: hyps) (J: class) (t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 z a b: set): $ G ⇒ ra_ctors_wf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 z ∈ lrel3 J $ > $ G ⇒ z = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons a (scons b ∅) ⟩ $ > $ G ⇒ ra_cwf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ a ∈ lrel3 J ∧ ra_ctors_wf t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 b ∈ lrel3 J $
----
a1: $ G ⇒ (∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ t6 = x6 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_cnil , ∅ ⟩)) ∨ ∃ x1 ∃ x2 ∃ x3 ∃ x4 ∃ x5 ∃ x6 ∃ x7 ∃ x8 (t1 = x1 ∧ t2 = x2 ∧ t3 = x3 ∧ t4 = x4 ∧ t5 = x5 ∧ t6 = x6 ∧ z = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons x7 (scons x8 ∅) ⟩ ∧ ra_cwf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x6 ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ x7 ∈ lrel3 J ∧ ra_ctors_wf x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x6 x8 ∈ lrel3 J) $ by lrel3_ctors_wf_cases [#1]
