b2: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons x1 (scons x2 ∅) ⟩ ∧ p = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = x1 ⇒ p = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ $ by and_elim_l [br1]
b3: $ G , z = ⟨ kc_ccons , scons x1 (scons x2 ∅) ⟩ ∧ p = ⟨ kc_nz , ∅ ⟩ ∧ e = x1 ⇒ e = x1 $ by and_elim_r [br1]
