--| The types valued by a larger candidate have larger entries, pairwise.
lemma i9_ixs_pt {i v v2: set} (G: hyps) (D W Z Z2: class) (u: set): $ G ⇒ universe u $ > $ G ⇒ Z2 ∈ u $ > $ G ⇒ Z2 ⊆ ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u)) $ > $ G ⇒ Z ⊆ Z2 $ > $ G ⇒ ∀ i ∀ v (⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z → ∃ v2 (⟨ i , v2 ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z2 ∧ v ⊆ v2)) $
----
k1: $ G ⇒ Z ∈ u $ by universe_subset_c [#1, #2, #4]
k2: $ G ⇒ Z ⊆ ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u)) $ by subset_trans [#4, #3]
p1: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z ⇒ c ∊ ixs D W Z $ by ax
p2: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z ⇒ ∃ j (j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩) $ by cab_elim [p1]
r0: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ $ by ax
r1: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ intys D $ by and_elim_l [r0]
r2: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⇒ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ $ by and_elim_r [r0]
r3a: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⇒ c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ $ by ax
r3b: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ i , v ⟩ = c $ by eq_sym [r3a]
r3: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⇒ ⟨ i , v ⟩ = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ $ by eq_trans [r3b, r2]
r4a: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⇒ universe u $ by weaken [#1]
r4b: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⇒ Z ∈ u $ by weaken [k1]
r4c: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⇒ Z ⊆ ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u)) $ by weaken [k2]
r5: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⇒ ient D W Z j ∈ u $ by ient_universe [r4a, r4b, r4c]
r5b: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⇒ isset (ient D W Z j) $ by wcel_isset [r5]
r6a: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⇒ isset i $ by isset_var
r6b: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⇒ isset v $ by isset_var
r6c: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⇒ isset j $ by isset_var
r6: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⇒ i = j ∧ v = ient D W Z j $ by opair_inj_c [r3, r6a, r6b, r6c, r5b]
r6d: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⇒ i = j $ by and_elim_l [r6]
r7: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⇒ v = ient D W Z j $ by and_elim_r [r6]
r8a: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⇒ Z2 ∈ u $ by weaken [#2]
r8c: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⇒ Z2 ⊆ ω × (fseq u × fseq (ω ∪ u)) $ by weaken [#3]
r8: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⇒ ient D W Z2 j ∈ u $ by ient_universe [r4a, r8a, r8c]
r8b: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ ⇒ isset (ient D W Z2 j) $ by wcel_isset [r8]
t0a: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ , e = ient D W Z2 j , h = ⟨ i , e ⟩ ⇒ h = ⟨ i , e ⟩ $ by ax
