t0e: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ , e = ient D W Z2 j , h = ⟨ i , e ⟩ ⇒ h = ⟨ j , ient D W Z2 j ⟩ $ by eq_trans [t0a, t0d]
t0f: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ , e = ient D W Z2 j , h = ⟨ i , e ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ intys D $ by weaken [r1]
t0g: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ , e = ient D W Z2 j , h = ⟨ i , e ⟩ ⇒ j ∊ intys D ∧ h = ⟨ j , ient D W Z2 j ⟩ $ by and_intro [t0f, t0e]
t0: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ , e = ient D W Z2 j , h = ⟨ i , e ⟩ ⇒ ∃ j (j ∊ intys D ∧ h = ⟨ j , ient D W Z2 j ⟩) $ by ex_intro [t0g]
t1a: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ , e = ient D W Z2 j ⇒ isset ⟨ i , e ⟩ $ by opair_isset
t1: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ , e = ient D W Z2 j ⇒ ⟨ i , e ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z2 $ by wcel_cab_intro [t1a, t0]
