t3: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ , e = ient D W Z2 j ⇒ ⟨ i , e ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z2 ∧ v ⊆ e $ by and_intro [t1, t2]
t4: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z , j ∊ intys D ∧ c = ⟨ j , ient D W Z j ⟩ , e = ient D W Z2 j ⇒ ∃ v2 (⟨ i , v2 ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z2 ∧ v ⊆ v2) $ by ex_intro [t3]
