t6: $ G , ⟨ i , v ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z , c = ⟨ i , v ⟩ , c ∊ ixs D W Z ⇒ ∃ v2 (⟨ i , v2 ⟩ ∈ ixs D W Z2 ∧ v ⊆ v2) $ by ex_elim [p2, t5]
